<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Browsers that draw their pages without Android's autofill structure are filled in compatibility
    mode: Android reads the page through accessibility and takes the site from the address bar, by
    the address bar ids in its own list of allowed browsers. A browser on that list is filled only
    if it is also named here. Firefox and the browsers built on GeckoView are left out, since they
    give Android a real structure and compatibility mode would only stand in its way.
-->
